      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "prometheus-stack (=82.4.3) and spegel (=0.7.2) pin an exact semver while application charts such as n8n use a range (>=1.10.0 <2.0.0); exact pins keep Renovate in control of upgrades for charts whose CRDs/node-level components can break the cluster."
